Kenneth,

Following your 8 October request to check the basis before Japan Finance uses=
 the figure internally, Connor and I found that the same exception-pack prepa=
ration was counted twice. I am sending the attached correction now so that th=
e old amount does not travel further in the internal explanation.

Please replace JPY 26m with the corrected annualised estimate of JPY 22m in t=
he Japan Finance departmental explanation, including the definition of the fi=
gure. JPY 18m values work capacity that could be redeployed; JPY 4m is an est=
imate of overtime premium avoided only if the relevant approved premium payme=
nts actually fall. Neither the total nor the capacity value is a realised fir=
st-year saving. I am sorry we carried the duplicate into the earlier estimate.

At our progress check on 21 October, could we confirm where the replacement h=
as been made and address any questions from Finance?

Best,
Nicholas

